The results show that annual eGFR decline was associated with incident CVD, with a statistically significant hazard ratio after adjustment for proteinuria and reduced eGFR. However, the cohort comes from routine health checkups and residual confounding is a limitation of this observational design. Weighing everything, I will give both readings.
</think>
